{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52507","headline":"赐姚崇 · 武则天","name":"赐姚崇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"依依柳色变，处处春风起。\n借问向盐池，何如游滻水？\n（见胡聘之《山右石刻丛编》卷五高宗《过楼岩寺》诗附韦元晨《六绝纪文》引。\n作於长安二年。\n时姚崇按察蒲州盐池事返，赐以此诗。\n题据韦文拟。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武则天","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}